OL,3,GNEWSARSPCA's longest-staying dog finds
OL,4,Anew home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dog named Delboy - who spent nearly
OL,7,Ftwo years in the RSPCA's care - has
OL,8,Ffinally been rehomed.
OL,10,FThe French bulldog cross arrived at
OL,11,FLongview Animal Centre in Stalmine,
OL,12,FLancashire in October 2024 and became
OL,13,Fthe centre's longest-staying resident.
OL,15,FHis new owners, Mike and Corrine Neale,
OL,16,Ffrom the Fylde coast, visited the
OL,17,Frehoming centre 10 times to build up a
OL,18,Frapport with him.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
